{"unit_id":"sxwsc667__dsh-use-computer#card-zh","repo":"sxwsc667/dsh-use-computer","commit":"997633c3c6c684cd9d02ca5e5fbfc17cd12be1a0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-use-computer（DSH 插件，web 客户端）：让模型直接查看并操作 Windows 桌面。它在 DSH 主对话注册桌面工具，由本机助手执行截图、控件查找、鼠标点击、文字输入和按键；定位优先查 UIA 控件树，必要时使用本地视觉模型。主要功能包括查看屏幕、按描述定位目标、点击与输入，以及用脚本串联多步动作。适合希望让 DSH 在 Windows 应用中完成界面操作的用户。使用视觉定位需自行准备 UGround 模型和 llama.cpp 服务；不需要 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:438-468","index.js:624-638","index.js:1042-1066","lib/grounding-client.js:22-35"]}
{"unit_id":"sxwsc667__dsh-use-computer#card-en","repo":"sxwsc667/dsh-use-computer","commit":"997633c3c6c684cd9d02ca5e5fbfc17cd12be1a0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-use-computer is a DSH plugin for operating a Windows desktop. It captures screens, locates controls, clicks, types, and runs multi-step scripts. It tries UI Automation first and can use a local vision model. Visual grounding needs UGround files and llama.cpp; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:438-468","index.js:624-638","index.js:1042-1066","lib/grounding-client.js:22-35"]}
